From the problem, We have that $DE = 1.5\text{m},$ $AC = 3\text{m},$ and $AD = 2.5\text{m}.$ Therefore, $DC = AC - AD = 0.5\text{m}.$ We desire $AB.$ From $\triangle ABC \sim \triangle DEC,$ we get:

