\multicolumn{2}{r}{} & -11x^2& -22x\\ 
\cline{3-4}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{} & & +17x & -8 \\ 
\multicolumn{2}{r}{} & & +17x & +34 \\ 
\cline{4-5}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{} & & & -42 \\ 
\end{array}
\]Thus, the quotient is $\boxed{7x^2 - 11x + 17}.$

